WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Big Panic in the Real World

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Digimon Army Advances

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:07.840
Big Panic in the Real World!

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.570
The Digimon Army Advances!

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.170
Ikuto was reunited with his parents,

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:17.470
but he still wasn't prepared to face this reality.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:22.770
His residual emotions brought forth a new Digimon from the Digital World.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:27.640
Ikuto was able to successfully save his mother,

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:34.070
but he fled when Governor Hashiba's personnel from the Ministry of Confidentiality arrived to chase him down.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.410
Are you getting cold feet, Mercurimon?

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:49.030
I can't believe such cowardly words were uttered by the man who had once ruled the Digital World's woodlands.

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:56.630
You are... SaberLeomon!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.050
It's been a long time, my friend.

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.020
Why are you here?

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.650
You should know well enough.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:06.940
I've come to give your rear a good kick forward.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:09.060
What did you say?

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:16.400
Right now, the Digital World is facing peril that it has never known the likes of before.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.830
If you continue to let these humans do as they please, it will be too late for us.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:26.770
Mercurimon, you should already know this.

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:29.330
SaberLeomon, you...

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:35.620
There are many Digimon who agree with me.

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:41.770
Before it's too late, attack the human world and wipe them out!

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:42.600
What?

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:44.520
Mercurimon.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.600
Fight this battle with me! That way...

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:51.770
Our companions will not escape injury if you go through with this!

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:55.870
Sacrifices must be minimal.

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:59.240
Let us deal with only the humans who have intruded into our world.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.860
In other words, you do not want to join forces with me?

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:04.620
Do you have a problem with my methods?

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.580
They're pathetic!

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:14.750
Your ways cannot protect the Digital World!

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:19.930
Looks like I have to turn to another direction.

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:23.890
At least, don't get in my way.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:49.960
Damn it, where'd he run to?

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.040
Split up and look. We must find him!

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.630
It's okay, Ikuto. They're gone.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.050
Found him!

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:08.560
This way!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.770
You can't run anymore!

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:16.900
Damn it!

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.400
Ikuto, get in!

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.380
Hurry up!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:28.500
All right, Yoshino!

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.350
Okay!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:30.390
Sit tight!

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.250
Damn it, those guys...!

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:44.500
SaberLeomon-sama!

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:47.640
Please wait!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.040
What is it?

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:56.050
SaberLeomon-sama's intentions, I...

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.470
I truly admire!

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:02.140
I have been sharing those same exact thoughts!

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.840
If you will allow me to partake in your mighty determination...

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.620
What are you trying to say?

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.080
I want to fight with you!

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.800
What?

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:15.250
I have experience in crossing over to the human world.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:20.650
I believe this knowledge of mine will aid you in achieving a soaring victory!

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.210
I see.

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:28.090
If SaberLeomon-sama were to give me some troops,

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:29.930
I will direct the advance guard...

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:35.850
And be of great service to you!

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.610
Interesting.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:51.100
So you disregarded Governor Hashiba's orders and brought him here?

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.850
Everything is a misunderstanding.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:55.210
It'll all clear up with some investigation.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:57.650
Ikuto was just trying to protect his parents!

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:58.480
That's right!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.400
We'll need an urgent counter-plan.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.900
I don't believe they'll leave us alone with the way things are.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:11.410
But we didn't do anything wrong!

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.010
That's right!

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.630
But, good or bad intentions aside...

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:19.330
The fact still remains that we helped Ikuto escape from under their noses.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:23.310
It's only a matter of time before they demand that we hand him over.

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:27.760
Ikuto.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:32.260
At any rate, it's not a good idea to keep Ikuto here.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.710
Yes.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:37.200
Find a safer place and move him there.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.140
In that case, he can come to my house.

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:40.240
Right, Agumon?

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:40.940
Yeah!

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:42.560
No objections, right?

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:44.450
No objections, right?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.400
You don't object either, right?

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.710
Iku... to?

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:50.570
Ikuto?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.130
Ikuto!

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:54.330
Falcomon!

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:54.950
Oh, great...

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:57.420
Where could he have gone?

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.410
Did he run away?

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.620
He couldn't have gone very far.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:02.120
Find him!

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.440
Yes, sir!

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.440
Yes, sir!

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:09.300
Man, he's always needs looking after!

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:23.720
Ikuto, where are you planning to go?

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:36.030
Ikuto...

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:37.500
Hey, Ikuto!

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.240
Shut up!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:39.910
You go back!

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:42.690
Go back? But to where?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.760
Back to Digital World.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.580
You can still go back.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.540
But I want to go back with you...!

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:49.870
I can't...

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:53.340
I don't belong anywhere anymore.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.240
Ikuto...

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.870
Don't follow me!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:57.820
Ikuto!

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.950
Ikuto!

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:08.440
Ikuto... That's mean, just dumping me like that...

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.370
Ikuto!!!

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:13.990
Ikuto!

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:15.380
Ikuto!

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.370
Man, this sucks... where'd he run off to?

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.370
This really sucks...

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:29.210
Since he's wearing those eye-catching clothes...

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:31.300
You'd think it would be easy for anyone to spot him...

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.730
But really, he's so reckless!

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:38.500
Yoshino.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:39.780
What's the situation?

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:40.770
Nothing.

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:42.340
I can't find him at all.

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:44.040
Same here.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.940
I can't find any leads on him.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:49.400
He should be with Falcomon.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:52.010
Have you found his Digimon signal?

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:55.360
Still looking. I haven't found any traces yet.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:29.350
I'm exhausted...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.830
Damn that squirt for making people worry about him...

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:38.610
Agumon!

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:40.310
When did you come out here?!

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:42.530
Gah, it's cold! Stop it!

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:45.200
Maybe they've gotten lost.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.780
Yeah, this is Masaru.

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:49.670
There's a Digimon signal?

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.680
Did they find Ikuto and Falcomon?

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.180
It isn't them?

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:55.790
What do you mean?

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:56.990
What?

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:58.630
Look to the sky?

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:03.530
This is...

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:05.880
An alarming number of Digimon signals are appearing!

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:08.690
Over here too, new Digimon signals are appearing everywhere!

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:10.010
They're increasing rapidly!

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.870
The moment we've feared is finally here.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:19.640
That's...?!

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:23.620
What a shocking number!

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:46.510
Pteranomon

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:39.340
Pteranomon.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:42.550
An Armor Type Digimon that can launch devastating attacks from the sky.

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:44.370
Its special attack is Beak Pierce.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.510
It uses its sharp beak to attack its opponents.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:50.690
Wh-What are they?!

00:10:52.850 --> 00:11:02.030
Boarmon

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:54.530
Boarmon.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:57.800
An Armor Type Digimon that is unstoppable once it starts running.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.830
Its special attack is Nose Blaster.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:02.030
It blows out red-hot air from its nose.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.010
Master...

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:10.190
What on earth is going on?

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:30.770
Digimon signals are increasing!

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.040
Counting 70...

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:33.880
80...

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:34.730
90...

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:35.870
120...

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:37.550
360!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.230
No, I can't keep up with their numbers!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:42.200
Announce the first stage of alarm!

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:46.220
Notify the various police departments of the situation.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.660
Priority is to evacuate all surrounding neighborhoods.

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.580
Masaru, Yoshino, Tohma.

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:53.560
Sir!

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:54.270
Sir!

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:55.110
Sir!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.800
All members meet at Point Y408!

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:04.930
We'll group our war potential in the same place and work together to stop them!

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:08.410
Tohma!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.260
Masaru!

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:10.950
Yoshino!

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.690
This really is the worst...

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:15.440
But we can't just sit by and watch!

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:18.440
But... how are we going to get rid of all these Digimon?

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:20.750
It doesn't matter how many there are!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.660
We'll get rid of every last one!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:24.650
What a Masaru-like way of thinking.

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:26.930
Even if there's one or two hundred of them or whatever...

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:30.620
this street fighter, Masaru-sama, will destroy 'em all!

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.510
The day to repay those humans is finally here!

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:47.300
So that they can never... never come into the Digital World again...

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.800
Destroy everything!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:53.890
Begin the attack!

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:20.540
Marvel Shot!

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:27.810
Hurry and run!

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:28.970
Lilamon, behind you!

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:35.230
Lilamon!

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.420
Are you all right?

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.400
MachGaogamon.

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.110
Thank you, Tohma.

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:48.880
No need for that. Let's go!

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:49.240
Yeah!

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:55.880
Digisoul...

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:01.560
Full Charge!

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:05.730
Agumon, evolve!

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.480
RiseGreymon!

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:51.300
The situation is desperate.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.630
They won't last much longer at this rate.

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:01.740
Governor... Hashiba.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:18.560
RiseGreymon!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:19.700
Don't back down, go!!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:25.900
Marvel Shot!

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:32.690
Lilamon!

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.100
It's no use, there's too many!

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:44.470
There's no end to this!

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:48.780
Fighting one-on-one is no sweat, but their numbers are just too much!

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.510
If this keeps up...

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.760
Keep your chin up!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.200
The fight's just beginning!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:57.700
Yoshino!

00:15:58.190 --> 00:15:58.660
Master!

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:08.900
PawnChessmon?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:09.820
Hi~

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:14.750
We've come to save you!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.840
Leave the defense to us!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:22.080
Digisoul Charge!

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:39.870
KnightChessmon

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:39.870
Adult Level

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:34.160
KnightChessmon.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:36.840
An Adult Level Digimon who carries huge darts.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:39.870
Galloping like centaurs, they disquiet the enemy!

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.770
All right, start counterattacking!

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:44.040
Attention humans.

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:49.040
We will now cease our attack for one hour.

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:50.650
What?

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.010
They're willing to make a cease-fire?

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:59.930
During that time, if you accept our conditions, we will return to the Digital World.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.390
There are two conditions.

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:09.360
One, destroy all transportation equipment in the human world which connects to the Digital World.

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:15.360
And two, hand over the cause of this entire calamity, Ikuto.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.030
No way...

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:21.910
What is that asshole saying?

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:23.330
Cut the crap!

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:25.560
There's no way we'll accept such conditions!

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:27.520
No, we'll accept them.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.620
Governor Hashiba?

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:33.630
All three of you will immediately search for Ikuto and capture him.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:37.810
Hurry and hand him over to the other party.

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:40.430
Don't give me that crap! How far are you gonna...!

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.540
Calm down.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:46.640
This is the sacrifice of one person over the lives of thousands of others.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:50.350
Which one is more important? Surely I don't have to say it?

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:52.330
Damn you!

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.660
Unfortunately,

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:55.820
this is the decision of the government.

00:17:56.690 --> 00:17:58.320
We cannot overrule it.

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:04.530
Look over there!

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:05.630
Ikuto!

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.650
Gotsumon! I'm right here!

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.870
So stop attacking!

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:12.670
Oh?

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:14.600
How admirable of you.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.380
What's brought about this change of attitude?

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.320
Hurry up and do it!

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:21.070
Then go back to your Digital World!

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:22.210
Very well.

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:23.930
Then let me...

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:24.390
Stop!

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:25.380
Ikuto!

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.910
You don't have to do that!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.060
Don't come!

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:31.420
I'm... bringer of disaster.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.730
I don't belong... anywhere!

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:35.620
Shut up!

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.720
You find for yourself the place you belong in!

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:40.000
If there isn't one, then you make one!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:43.890
Don't lose hope and do this kind of stupid thing! It won't make anyone happy!

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:45.190
No one...

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:47.590
No one needs me!

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:48.750
So leave me alone!

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.210
Let's end this little drama!

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:00.220
Falcomon! Why?

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:02.480
Don't ask why!

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:04.320
We're friends, remember?

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:09.990
Now I don't have anywhere else to go either. Just like you, Ikuto.

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:11.540
Falcomon...

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.460
I love you, Ikuto.

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.990
That's why I don't need to belong anywhere.

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:20.860
As long as I'm always with you!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:26.950
I don't care if you're a human or a Digimon.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:29.830
To me, you are you, Ikuto!

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.620
Falcomon...

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:34.710
So Ikuto, let me fight with you!

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:42.990
Falcomon, evolve!

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:01.000
Peckmon!

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:07.740
Looks like you've decided to call off the truce.

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.060
Attack!

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:10.820
Attack all over again!

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.720
Turn everything into dust!

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.540
Marvel Shot!

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:19.770
Kunai Bane!

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:46.230
Well, well, well...

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:49.910
Looks like everyone from DATS is fighting a bitter battle.

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:58.260
Let me help you... Be grateful about this.

00:20:58.260 --> 00:21:00.140
It's showtime!

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:06.610
Wh-What is this?!

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.130
A Digital Gate?

